{%- comment -%}
  LoveLaRice brand typography.

  Cormorant Garamond is not part of Shopify's font library, so it cannot be
  selected as a native theme font. It is loaded here from Google Fonts (using
  the same weights as the homepage section so the browser reuses the cache) and
  applied to the heading and accent CSS variables. This snippet is rendered
  after theme-styles-variables and color-schemes in theme.liquid, so the
  override below wins. Body and subheading text continue to use Outfit (the
  native Shopify font configured in theme settings).
{%- endcomment -%}
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
<link
  rel="stylesheet"
  href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Cormorant+Garamond:ital,wght@0,300;0,400;0,500;0,600;1,400;1,500&display=swap"
>
<style>
  :root {
    --font-heading--family: 'Cormorant Garamond', Georgia, 'Times New Roman', serif !important;
    --font-accent--family: 'Cormorant Garamond', Georgia, 'Times New Roman', serif !important;
  }
</style>
